
1、Dataset  https://drive.google.com/drive/my-drive?dmr=1&ec=wgc-drive-hero-goto
2、For KIR dataset：
   dat file reading format:
Binary file, starting from 264 bytes, with a total length of 65000 bytes, divided into 13 groups, 
corresponding to channels AG11, AG12, AG13, AG21, AG22, AG23, AG31, AG32, AG33, AC1, AC2, AC3, AC4.
5000 digits in each group, with individual digits formatted in SGL single precision. 
The dt value converted to waveform is 0.00002.
